<title>USA: Domenici says US budget talks still making strides.</title>
<headline>Domenici says US budget talks still making strides.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Senate Budget Committee Chairman Pete Domenici said Wednesday budget negotiators are making progress, but some major issues remain.</p>
<p>&quot;We're still making strides, we're still some major issues away from resolution and we just have to stay with it,&quot; the New Mexico Republican told reporters before a hearing.</p>
</text>
